# No PDFs are ever tracked in this repository.
#
# Generated contracts hold borrower personal information: name, department,
# equipment loaned, and replacement values. Signed contracts live in the BDI
# staff Google Drive folder linked in the README. The _sample_*_preview.pdf
# files in this folder are real generated output, so they are ignored too --
# they stay on disk as local reference but are never committed.
*.pdf
Signed/
signed/

# Google Drive shortcut stubs and OS clutter
*.gdoc
*.gsheet
*.gslides
desktop.ini
~$*
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
